=== 4-fold lift / branching tree of c-map ===

From each c-edge q -> c, take the c-image point P0 on E_PCP(c),
add 2-torsion translates to get 4 lifts P0,P0+T1,P0+T2,P0+T3,
re-apply c-map from c to get 4 candidate next-rationals c'.
Check F3' = 1 + c^2 + c'^2 for square.

